OL,3,AUK government rejects 'kill switch'
OL,4,Aidea for dangerous AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has rejected the idea
OL,7,Fof creating a so-called "kill switch"
OL,8,Fto stop a dangerous attack from rogue
OL,9,FAI.
OL,11,FThe proposal to create a legal
OL,12,Fmechanism for the UK to switch off an
OL,13,FAI model in an emergency has been
OL,14,Fbrought to Parliament by lords and MPs
OL,15,Fin recent weeks as fears grow about the
OL,16,Fthreat the tech poses.
OL,18,FBut the Cabinet Office - the part of
OL,19,Fgovernment which leads on AI safety -
OL,20,Fsaid the UK "cannot simply turn AI
OL,21,Foff".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
